                <div>
                    <div id="divMainDecTilte" class="heading-four" style="text-align: left;">Declarations and Reservations</div>
                    <div id="divDecTilte" class="heading-four-one normal">(Unless otherwise indicated, the declarations and reservations were made<br>upon ratification, acceptance, accession or succession.)<br></div>

                    <div>
	<table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0" border="0" id="dgNotes" width="100%">
		<tr align="left" valign="top">
			<td>
                                    <div id="dgNotes_ctl71_divMainText"></div>
                                    <div id="dgNotes_ctl71_divParticipant" class="heading-two">Türkiye</div>
                                    <div id="dgNotes_ctl71_divText" class="content-two"><p><p class='invisible'>Türkiye</p><p align=left><i>Reservation made upon signature and confirmed upon ratification:<br></p></n></i></p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;The Republic of Turkey reserves the right to interpret and apply the provisions of articles 17, 29 and 30 of the United Nations Convention on the Rights of the Child according to the letter and the spirit of the Constitution of the Republic of Turkey and those of the Treaty of Lausanne of 24 July 1923.<br></n><br></div>
                                </td>
		</tr>
